      "side": 1,
      "message": "You are right this definitely changes behavior. I assumed places that need to modify the underlying SkPathRef only do it if the path is unique, otherwise they copy. For example, moveTo. The one place I had to change to make this work is interpolate, it was assuming the current implementation.\n\nI can do a more localized change in the chrome side, but it seemed like a general issue. If you\u0027re worried there are compatibility issues, I can look to change chrome to avoid addPath() in empty cases.",
      "parentUuid": "1ac4e641_a243644e",
      "revId": "24b5ab41320bfc2c0aac8e71715d8a8c1d7bf909",
