      "message": "I don\u0027t think this actually changes behavior? It\u0027s the same as just doing an assignment, right? The path will later detect the non-unique ownership of the path-ref, and make a copy at the time of edit:\nhttps://fiddle.skia.org/c/b48d312fab531f6e1f8e665f16dffe51",
